00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.880
My name is Florian Carle.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.560
I'm the manager of the
Yale Quantum Institute,

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.900
and I'll be one of the
moderators for this panel.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.870
