quantum mechanics further.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.720
And then when I came to grad school,

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:31.330
I was very intrigued by the
fact that you could compute

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.017
using the principles of quantum mechanics.

00:05:33.017 --> 00:05:35.630
You can imagine building
an operating system

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.680
based on quantum mechanics.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.690
So that was just completely bizarre

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:45.690
