00:51:16.433 --> 00:51:18.540
So just try it.

00:51:18.540 --> 00:51:21.740
If that's something that you
wanna do, don't worry about

00:51:21.740 --> 00:51:23.750
whether you think you're
good or bad, or whatever.

00:51:23.750 --> 00:51:24.750
Just give it a shot.

